  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "ModuleRegistry acts as the core Plugin Manager for the JARVIS system, centralizing the discovery, loading, and activation of all functional modules. It maintains a registry of active modules, allowing the application to access specialized capabilities via a unified interface. The service orchestrates initialization by checking configuration flags against a manifest, providing controlled runtime behavior. It supports dynamic retrieval, iteration, and safe lifecycle management (load/unload) of installed plugins."
